      "SectionPath": [
        "Metrics Definition for Member Post Analytics",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "For the entity parameter, if the URN is a ugcPostUrn, use entity=(ugc:urn%3Ali%3AugcPost%3A7325786486870552578). If the URN is a shareUrn, use entity=(share:urn%3Ali%3Ashare%3A7325786486870552578).",
